/*
+==============================================================+
|   THE SURGEON BOT v2 — FMZ QUANT                           |
|   Strategy: Dual-TF EMA Crossover + ADX + ATR-Based SL/TP  |
|   Binance USDT-M Futures | Backtest + Live                  |
+==============================================================+

STRATEGY OVERVIEW:
  Timeframes : M15 (entry) + H4 (trend confirmation)
  Indicators : EMA3, EMA8 on M15 & H4
               EMA200 on H4 (major trend filter)
               VWAP on M15 (entry filter)
               ADX(14) on M15 (volatility gate, min 20)
               ATR(14) on M15 (dynamic SL/TP sizing)

  LONG  : H4 bullish (EMA3>EMA8 & price>EMA200) + M15 EMA3 crosses EMA8 up
           + price above VWAP + ADX > 20 + ATR spike
  SHORT : H4 bearish (EMA3<EMA8 & price<EMA200) + M15 EMA3 crosses EMA8 down
           + price below VWAP + ADX > 20 + ATR spike

  SL  = entry ± 1.5 × ATR
  TP  = entry ± 3.0 × ATR  (R:R = 2:1)
  Size = (balance × 2%) / SL distance

  Max Drawdown : 20% → close trade + 12-hour cooldown

TWO MODES:
  LIVE_MODE = false → Multi-symbol backtest simulation (20 symbols)
  LIVE_MODE = true  → Live trading on LIVE_SYMBOL (BTC_USDT)

HOW TO RUN BACKTEST:
  1. Set LIVE_MODE = false below
  2. Paste into FMZ → Strategy → Save
  3. Click "Run" in live mode (NOT backtest tab) — needed for symbol switching
  4. Results will be printed as a ranked table
  NOTE: Each symbol uses ~2000 M15 candles (~20 days) from the exchange.

HOW TO RUN LIVE:
  1. Set LIVE_MODE = true, set LIVE_SYMBOL to your desired pair
  2. Configure Binance Futures Testnet exchange in FMZ
  3. Set leverage to match LEVERAGE in the FMZ exchange config
  4. Click "Start Live"
*/

